        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/3b91f8b26e11b3d831150cd6f482af33.avif?t=1784672964\" width=630 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Welcome to Obstacle Challenge</strong>. This game if my first ever developer experience and its welcomes all hardcore challengers!This game is not just entertainment, but also a part of your journey of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you in this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Fortification</strong>: You'll elevate your focus to its peak, sharpen your memory, and enhance your problem-solving abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Resilience</strong>: Before experiencing the deepest joy of winning, you'll learn to confront the lessons that come with losing. Every mistake will bring you one step closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulslike Touch of Difficulty</strong>: As a Soulslike player, I've personally designed challenging obstacles that await you in later levels, pushing you to your limits. What seems simple at first glance possesses a surprising depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulties  and Determination on the Path to Success:</strong> Although the challenges you face may sometimes make you angry, the motivation and sense of accomplishment you'll feel after completing each stage will provide invaluable self-confidence. With every obstacle overcome, you'll discover the power within you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Only the most skilled players have been able to complete the final level in just 8 minutes. You're next.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Overcome the obstacles, challenge yourself, and feel the freedom that comes with success!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.poster.avif?t=1784672964\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.webm?t=1784672964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.mp4?t=1784672964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/3b91f8b26e11b3d831150cd6f482af33.avif?t=1784672964\" width=630 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Welcome to Obstacle Challenge</strong>. This game if my first ever developer experience and its welcomes all hardcore challengers!This game is not just entertainment, but also a part of your journey of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you in this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Fortification</strong>: You'll elevate your focus to its peak, sharpen your memory, and enhance your problem-solving abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Resilience</strong>: Before experiencing the deepest joy of winning, you'll learn to confront the lessons that come with losing. Every mistake will bring you one step closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulslike Touch of Difficulty</strong>: As a Soulslike player, I've personally designed challenging obstacles that await you in later levels, pushing you to your limits. What seems simple at first glance possesses a surprising depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulties  and Determination on the Path to Success:</strong> Although the challenges you face may sometimes make you angry, the motivation and sense of accomplishment you'll feel after completing each stage will provide invaluable self-confidence. With every obstacle overcome, you'll discover the power within you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Only the most skilled players have been able to complete the final level in just 8 minutes. You're next.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Overcome the obstacles, challenge yourself, and feel the freedom that comes with success!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.poster.avif?t=1784672964\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.webm?t=1784672964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960780/extras/4ee3c78fe7976b24a8af03557df02d79.mp4?t=1784672964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
